{"item_id":"feed:https://precisionrifleblog.com/2026/09/25/2026-iprf-world-championship-halftime-update-predictions/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=2026-iprf-world-championship-halftime-update-predictions","version_id":"d2ea86ab0eac2d6f41616cf24eca6098642fe237f603df0d70a34c7cf79c8603","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this analysis of IPRF scores and revised winning probabilities provides no evidence about eligible gear or its suitability for Mammoth conditions. The source is described as independent, and no relevant commercial relationship is disclosed.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://precisionrifleblog.com/2026/09/20/who-will-win-the-2026-iprf-world-championship-top-50-predictions-division-favorites/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=who-will-win-the-2026-iprf-world-championship-top-50-predictions-division-favorites","version_id":"6635dbce32f941ddce5042392d29d8fbcb6d2c5f5b188aece31e09ea8029d23f","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, competitor forecasts and IPRF division rules do not help readers evaluate in-scope gear for Mammoth; the statistical model predicts match results rather than ballistic solutions. No relevant sponsorship or affiliate relationship is disclosed.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"youtube:G7aA3MD5ogk","version_id":"5536008ca0bf9d00c7cf0db1aff64af7638457a214b10b0e95afebcca523f40d","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this dedicated exercise-weight vest review does not establish a connection to carrying equipment or performing at Mammoth, despite observations about fit and heat buildup. Under Commercial incentives, GORUCK supplied both the vest and plates, reducing the independence of the praise.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"youtube:xv6hAL7bjwM","version_id":"c166f383b604f1f2a3563f2e75d135e2c4e44ccb96907ac6e548aec24d437492","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this review concerns adding fixed weight to ordinary fitness walks, with no demonstrated transfer to Mammoth equipment carriage or event conditions. Under Commercial incentives, GORUCK provided the vest; the reported comfort on hills and stairs does not establish event relevance.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"youtube:t5FATYZIcus","version_id":"34385f64b52d9cdac1e19c1796f0f720d4e5022b665653aca9ed9e57104c79ad","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, a fixed-weight vest used for dog walks and exercises offers no supported connection to what competitors should carry at Mammoth. Under Commercial incentives, the reviewer received the vest free from GORUCK and earns affiliate commissions.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"youtube:5ub3wKzHy40","version_id":"f40bc57f5c5aebb3932952c88d24e7add1be9f125d73106e2bbf377e2d1eae08","decision":"defer","reason":"Under Relevance, rucking footwear could transfer to Mammoth, but Credibility, Unsupported claims, and Making the decision favor deferral because brief comfort and footing impressions lack a described load, distance, duration, or weather exposure. Under Commercial incentives, GORUCK supplied the shoes and the reviewer uses affiliate links, so the broad endorsement needs stronger field evidence.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"youtube:Ry_3zPBi1J4","version_id":"b8e8e569ab20829c57868800c6549562b00e0a7de72ec3c1ec17a209bc7de3a3","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Making the decision, the described 20-pound plate plus equipment load, compartment-access observations, and lower-back numbness after roughly 90 minutes provide citable evidence for Pieces 02 and 03 about organization and carrying comfort. Under Commercial incentives and Uncertainty, disclose the free GORUCK bag and affiliate links, attribute these short-term findings to this reviewer, and avoid extrapolating to multi-day durability.","piece_ids":["02","03"]}
{"item_id":"youtube:SlW6o3cO2rk","version_id":"5ca634eff6f03866b6bc1390654fd24fc8195a9eccd8d6609b7dae04922f8109","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Making the decision, a described trail outing with a 20-pound plate, drone case, water, and first aid supplies yields specific observations about organization, lumbar support, and plate retention that support Pieces 02 and 03. Under Commercial incentives and Uncertainty, disclose GORUCK's free bag and affiliate links, qualify the two-week experience, and retain water resistance as an untested manufacturer claim.","piece_ids":["02","03"]}
{"item_id":"youtube:jVz1KOKvi-I","version_id":"4714b83e3be3ddc916c0b24744c8537d73118d77259689c70b8aaae4cd4f7da8","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Freshness and novelty, newly reported weeklong trail use with a 20-pound plate provides specific observations about load stability, lumbar comfort, absent chafing, and trap soreness, supporting Pieces 01, 02, and 03. Under Commercial incentives and Uncertainty, disclose the free GORUCK pack and affiliate commissions, and limit conclusions because rain resistance, long-term durability, the optional hip belt, and comparison with the 4.0 were not tested.","piece_ids":["01","02","03"]}
{"item_id":"youtube:Wj3YVuVhBes","version_id":"da162b9eda87a947e2a52247826987c4c3435845a76d0085ef4846964d83bdae","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this elk-hunting and company-culture film supplies no substantive gear evaluation transferable to Mammoth; hunting and game content are expressly rejected. Under Commercial incentives, Eberlestock produced the film around its own CEO and brand.","piece_ids":[]}
